This example's directory structure (the split between clusters/,
infrastructure/, and apps/, and the flux-system/ placeholder inside each
cluster directory) follows the layout used by:

  fluxcd/flux2-kustomize-helm-example
  https://github.com/fluxcd/flux2-kustomize-helm-example
