No file content from that repository is copied here. Every YAML file in this
directory was written for this example. The application content (the
apptique Deployment, Service, and Kustomize overlays) is reused from
the earlier apptique-flux-monorepo example in this repository, under this
repository's own MIT license (see the top-level LICENSE file).
